+/*
+ * Qualcomm Oryon: a DC ZVA executed while a CPU cluster enters (or sits in)
+ * a power-collapse idle state can hang and reset the whole SoC. No public
+ * erratum number; reproducer for the X Elite: icecream95/x1e-crash. The
+ * workaround is to never execute DC ZVA at all: EL0 traps and is emulated
