+ * paths (clear_page, memset, MTE page clearing) are patched out through the
+ * alternatives keyed on ARM64_WORKAROUND_QCOM_ORYON_DC_ZVA.
+ * qcom_oryon_dc_zva=off on the command line leaves DC ZVA enabled.
+ */
